      "first_line": 12,
      "last_line": 24,
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 266,
      "opening": "胡藩字道序，豫章南昌人也",
      "closing": "，時年六十二，諡曰壯侯。",
      "continuation_spans": [
        {
          "first_line": 26,
          "last_line": 26,
          "start_codepoint": 21,
          "end_codepoint": 34,
          "opening": "藩庶子六十人，多不遵法度",
          "closing": "庶子六十人，多不遵法度。"
        }
      ],
      "heading_line": 11,
      "heading_raw": "==胡藩=="
    },
    {
      "book_id": "b-songshu-050",
      "title": "胡隆世",
      "unit_kind": "embedded_account",
      "chapter_id": null,
      "entry_checked": true,
      "full_text": false,
      "first_pass": false,
      "item_reviewed": false,
      "source_layout": "wikisource_mixed_indented_prose",
      "first_line": 26,
      "last_line": 26,
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 16,
      "opening": "子隆世嗣，官至西陽太守。",
      "closing": "，官至西陽太守。隆世卒，",
      "parent_heading": "胡藩"
    },
    {
      "book_id": "b-songshu-050",
      "title": "胡乾秀",
      "unit_kind": "embedded_account",
      "chapter_id": null,
      "entry_checked": true,
      "full_text": false,
      "first_pass": false,
      "item_reviewed": false,
      "source_layout": "wikisource_mixed_indented_prose",
      "first_line": 26,
      "last_line": 26,
      "start_codepoint": 16,
      "end_codepoint": 21,
      "opening": "子乾秀嗣。",
      "closing": "子乾秀嗣。",
      "continuation_spans": [
        {
          "first_line": 26,
          "last_line": 26,
          "start_codepoint": 184,
          "end_codepoint": 189,
          "opening": "乾秀奪國。",
          "closing": "乾秀奪國。"
        }
      ],
      "parent_heading": "胡藩"
    },
    {
      "book_id": "b-songshu-050",
      "title": "胡遵世",
      "unit_kind": "embedded_account",
      "chapter_id": null,
      "entry_checked": true,
      "full_text": false,
      "first_pass": false,
      "item_reviewed": false,
      "source_layout": "wikisource_mixed_indented_prose",
      "first_line": 26,
      "last_line": 26,
      "start_codepoint": 34,
      "end_codepoint": 86,
      "opening": "藩第十四子遵世，為臧質寧",
      "closing": "事，使江州以他事收殺之。",
      "parent_heading": "胡藩"
    },
    {
      "book_id": "b-songshu-050",
      "title": "胡誕世、胡茂世",
      "unit_kind": "embedded_account",
      "chapter_id": null,
      "entry_checked": true,
      "full_text": false,
      "first_pass": false,
      "item_reviewed": false,
      "source_layout": "wikisource_mixed_indented_prose",
      "first_line": 26,
      "last_line": 26,
      "start_codepoint": 86,
      "end_codepoint": 153,
      "opening": "二十四年，藩第十六子誕世",
      "closing": "史檀和之至豫章，討平之。",
      "parent_heading": "胡藩",
      "scope_note": "十六子與十七子受一組述語，攻郡縣殺二官及討平同一事。"
    },
    {
      "book_id": "b-songshu-050",
      "title": "胡景世、胡寶世",
      "unit_kind": "embedded_account",
      "chapter_id": null,
      "entry_checked": true,
      "full_text": false,
      "first_pass": false,
      "item_reviewed": false,
      "source_layout": "wikisource_mixed_indented_prose",
      "first_line": 26,
      "last_line": 26,
      "start_codepoint": 153,
      "end_codepoint": 184,
      "opening": "誕世兄車騎參軍新興太守景",
      "closing": "，詣廷尉歸罪，並徙遠州。",
      "continuation_spans": [
        {
          "first_line": 26,
          "last_line": 26,
          "start_codepoint": 189,
          "end_codepoint": 199,
          "opening": "世祖初，徙者並得還。",
          "closing": "世祖初，徙者並得還。"
        }
      ],
      "parent_heading": "胡藩",
      "scope_note": "歸罪與同徙者具名二人，世祖初得還承徙者。"
    },
    {
      "book_id": "b-songshu-050",
      "title": "劉康祖",
      "unit_kind": "headed_account",
      "chapter_id": null,
      "entry_checked": true,
      "full_text": false,
      "first_pass": false,
      "item_reviewed": false,
      "source_layout": "wikisource_mixed_indented_prose",
      "first_line": 29,
      "last_line": 29,
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 14,
      "opening": "劉康祖，彭城呂人。世居京",
      "closing": "祖，彭城呂人。世居京口。",
      "continuation_spans": [
        {
          "first_line": 31,
          "last_line": 35,
          "start_codepoint": 0,
          "end_codepoint": 439,
          "opening": "康祖，虔之子也，襲封，為",
          "closing": "傳康祖首示彭城，面如生。"
        },
        {
          "first_line": 39,
          "last_line": 39,
          "start_codepoint": 0,
          "end_codepoint": 84,
          "opening": "二十八年，詔曰：「康祖班",
          "closing": "。」傳國至齊受禪，國除。"
        }
      ],
      "heading_line": 28,
      "heading_raw": "==劉康祖=="
    },
    {
      "book_id": "b-songshu-050",
      "title": "劉簡之",
      "unit_kind": "embedded_account",
      "chapter_id": null,
      "entry_checked": true,
      "full_text": false,
      "first_pass": false,
      "item_reviewed": false,
      "source_layout": "wikisource_mixed_indented_prose",
      "first_line": 29,
      "last_line": 29,
      "start_codepoint": 14,
      "end_codepoint": 150,
      "opening": "伯父簡之，有志榦，為高祖",
      "closing": "侍，少府，太尉諮議參軍。",
      "parent_heading": "劉康祖"
    },
    {
      "book_id": "b-songshu-050",
      "title": "劉謙之",
      "unit_kind": "embedded_account",
      "chapter_id": null,
      "entry_checked": true,
      "full_text": false,
      "first_pass": false,
      "item_reviewed": false,
      "source_layout": "wikisource_mixed_indented_prose",
      "first_line": 29,
      "last_line": 29,
      "start_codepoint": 150,
      "end_codepoint": 175,
      "opening": "簡之弟謙之，好學，撰晉紀",
      "closing": "十卷，義熙末，為始興相。",
      "continuation_spans": [
        {
          "first_line": 29,
          "last_line": 29,
          "start_codepoint": 242,
          "end_codepoint": 283,
          "opening": "謙之破走之，進平廣州，誅",
          "closing": "廣州刺史。後為太中大夫。"
        }
      ],
      "parent_heading": "劉康祖"
    },
    {
      "book_id": "b-songshu-050",
      "title": "徐道期",
      "unit_kind": "embedded_account",
      "chapter_id": null,
      "entry_checked": true,
      "full_text": false,
      "first_pass": false,
      "item_reviewed": false,
      "source_layout": "wikisource_mixed_indented_prose",
      "first_line": 29,
      "last_line": 29,
      "start_codepoint": 175,
      "end_codepoint": 242,
      "opening": "東海人徐道期流寓廣州，無",
      "closing": "庫，招集亡命，出攻始興。",
      "parent_heading": "劉康祖",
      "scope_note": "嵌在劉謙之事中，從籍貫與流寓廣州起，至出攻始興。"
    },
    {
      "book_id": "b-songshu-050",
      "title": "劉虔之",
      "unit_kind": "embedded_account",
      "chapter_id": null,
      "entry_checked": true,
      "full_text": false,
      "first_pass": false,
      "item_reviewed": false,
      "source_layout": "wikisource_mixed_indented_prose",
      "first_line": 29,
      "last_line": 29,
      "start_codepoint": 283,
      "end_codepoint": 442,
      "opening": "虔之誕節，不營產業，輕財",
      "closing": "封新康縣男，食邑五百戶。",
      "parent_heading": "劉康祖"
    },
    {
      "book_id": "b-songshu-050",
      "title": "胡盛之",
      "unit_kind": "embedded_account",
      "chapter_id": null,
      "entry_checked": true,
      "full_text": false,
      "first_pass": false,
      "item_reviewed": false,
      "source_layout": "wikisource_mixed_indented_prose",
      "first_line": 37,
      "last_line": 37,
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 72,
      "opening": "胡盛之為虜生禽，托跋燾寵",
      "closing": "挺身獨進，手斬五十八級。",
      "parent_heading": "劉康祖"
    },
    {
      "book_id": "b-songshu-050",
      "title": "垣護之",
      "unit_kind": "headed_account",
      "chapter_id": null,
      "entry_checked": true,
      "full_text": false,
